      "updated_at": "2021-05-05T08:53:52Z",
      "body": "Hi @ihor-sviziev @hostep, thanks for highlighting this issue. I wonder if this is still reproducible on 2.4-develop, as far as I can see the `getTransport()` method is always resetting its values since 2019.\r\n\r\n```\r\n    public function getTransport()\r\n    {\r\n        try {\r\n            $this->prepareMessage();\r\n            $mailTransport = $this->mailTransportFactory->create(['message' => clone $this->message]);\r\n        } finally {\r\n            $this->reset();\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        return $mailTransport;\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\n@ryanpalmerweb were you able to reproduce this issue on the latest release 2.4.2? Thanks!",
